@startuml
title Daily report period and export - REVIEW
[*] --> PREPARING : first period claim
PREPARING --> SNAPSHOT_FIXED : source membership + cutoff durably stored
SNAPSHOT_FIXED --> AGGREGATING : aggregate persisted contributions
AGGREGATING --> FINALIZED : counts / sums reconciled and published
AGGREGATING --> SNAPSHOT_FIXED : technical recovery\nreuse same membership
FINALIZED --> FINALIZED : late source => ADJUSTMENT in later period\nnever mutate finalized baseline
FINALIZED --> EXPORTED : optional complete CSV published
EXPORTED --> EXPORTED : export retry same immutable version
note right of SNAPSHOT_FIXED
 Retry never selects a newer baseline source set.
 Contribution unique per source transaction globally.
 BASE and ADJUSTMENT cannot both count one source.
end note
note right of FINALIZED
 recordedAt determines original day, only committed sources.
 Persisted snapshot membership determines inclusion.
 No physical commit timestamp / client backdating.
end note
@enduml
